  "created": "2026-10-17T00:40:10.237Z",
  "description": "A reflection-free, allocation-free JSON serializer: [JsonModel] source-generates idempotent readers and writers (UTF-16 and UTF-8) that implement ISpanFormattable / ISpanParsable, plus a zero-allocation JSON tape and a Newtonsoft-style DOM. Also includes Native AOT friendly System.Text.Json models (IJsonModel<TSelf>, [JsonModel], pooled element-wise JSON arrays), formerly Jakar.SystemTextJson; a type can use both generators side by side.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Jakar.Json",
  "isPrerelease": false,
